WEBVTT

00:02.920 --> 00:03.760
Your Majesty

00:03.840 --> 00:06.760
This servant recently heard some rumors in the streets

00:06.840 --> 00:09.173
Thought I must report to Your Majesty

00:10.040 --> 00:10.600
Saying

00:10.680 --> 00:12.080
People in the streets say

00:12.160 --> 00:14.080
There's a fortune teller in Qingzhou

00:14.160 --> 00:15.827
Who once met General Zhu

00:16.320 --> 00:17.720
Said

00:20.720 --> 00:21.640
What did he say?

00:21.760 --> 00:23.240
Said he observed the stars at night

00:23.360 --> 00:24.280
The Purple Star is dim

00:24.360 --> 00:25.600
The Emperor Star is unclear

00:25.680 --> 00:28.120
There's a sign of the Breaking Army rising in the east

00:28.200 --> 00:29.600
And also said

00:29.920 --> 00:31.320
On General Zhu's face

00:31.840 --> 00:33.240
There is royal aura
